Package: ReliefRouteIndia
Title: Dynamic Humanitarian Supply-Chain Router for India
Version: 2.0.0
Description: R Shiny dashboard that routes relief trucks around hazard zones
    using a Weighted Risk Index, live public data feeds and optimisation.
    This file lists dependencies for continuous integration only.
